        "mission_intent": "Team, we need to stand up a monitoring capability aligned with our NIST 800-53 Rev. 5 obligations around detecting unauthorized replication of organizational information by external entities. Specifically, I'd like the SOC to implement discovery processes\u2014including periodic scanning of external websites and social media channels\u2014to identify adversaries or hostile actors who may be impersonating our web presence or replicating our published content without authorization. Please coordinate with the threat intelligence team to define signatures and indicators we should be watching for, and build out a reporting workflow so that any confirmed instances of unauthorized replication are escalated to the incident response team and documented in our monthly security operations report. The report should include metrics on the number of external scans conducted, findings triaged, and confirmed incidents. I also need the team to develop a staff awareness brief so that personnel across the organization can recognize and report suspected unauthorized use of our information. Let's target initial operating capability by end of next quarter. Reach out if you have questions on tooling budget or access requirements.",
